{"id":"24c0bc5331222e31","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-asymmetric-relativization.md","title":"分别限制全称与存在量词的非对称解释","display":"df-asymmetric-relativization — 分别限制全称与存在量词的非对称解释","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-asymmetric-relativization","aliases":["18-df-asymmetric-relativization"],"display":"df-asymmetric-relativization — 分别限制全称与存在量词的非对称解释","depends_on":["[[./18-df-formula]]","[[./18-df-relativization]]","[[18-df-free-variable]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"Definition 12.7.1","source_printed_pages":"328","source_pdf_pages":"336","source_correspondence":"explicit-local-expansion","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13","source_proof_review":"定义的语法、类型及构造已核对；不据此宣称后续定理已证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"local_revision":"2026-10-14","local_review_scope":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification","prior_revision_verification_status":"source-definition-checked","source_statement_status_scope":"inherited record; not a new source check","prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-asymmetric-relativization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-asymmetric-relativization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-asymmetric-relativization — 分别限制全称与存在量词的非对称解释"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"./18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ccb1a85e29ea0a39\" href=\"?note=ccb1a85e29ea0a39\" title=\"./18-df-relativization\">18-df-relativization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" href=\"?note=0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" title=\"18-df-free-variable\">18-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 12.7.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"328"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"336"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"explicit-local-expansion"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"定义的语法、类型及构造已核对；不据此宣称后续定理已证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status_scope","html":"inherited record; not a new source check"},{"key":"prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0,\\ldots,A_k\">\\(A_0,\\ldots,A_k\\)</span> 是不同新常元。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\">\\(F,G\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=\\{\\in,=,\\mathrm{Ad}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L=\\{\\in,=,\\mathrm{Ad}\\}\\)</span> 的一阶公式（语法见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"./18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ad}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ad}\\)</span> 是一元关系符号；公式不含常元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le m,s\\le k\">\\(0\\le m,s\\le k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{(m,s)}\">\\(F^{(m,s)}\\)</span> 是下式的有限树递归。二元联结词与否定全部按显示语法递归，不把负号下的量词私自改写。原书采用的 Tait 正规形是此语法的子片段。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Delta\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_k^{(m,s)}(\\Delta)\">\\(D_k^{(m,s)}(\\Delta)\\)</span> 通过定义域恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 的选择函数取值，不使用未指定的公式枚举。目标语言为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_k=\\mathcal L\\cup\\{A_0,\\ldots,A_k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_k=\\mathcal L\\cup\\{A_0,\\ldots,A_k\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{A_m}\">\\(F^{A_m}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ccb1a85e29ea0a39\" href=\"?note=ccb1a85e29ea0a39\" title=\"./18-df-relativization\">18-df-relativization</a> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_k\">\\(\\mathcal L_k\\)</span> 中的实例。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nB^{(m,s)}&amp;\\coloneqq B &amp;&amp;(B\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L}),\\\\\n(\\neg F)^{(m,s)}&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg F^{(m,s)},\\\\\n(F\\circ G)^{(m,s)}&amp;\\coloneqq F^{(m,s)}\\circ G^{(m,s)}\n&amp;&amp;(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall x\\,F)^{(m,s)}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\,(x\\in A_m\\to F^{(m,s)}),\\\\\n(\\exists x\\,F)^{(m,s)}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\exists x\\,(x\\in A_s\\land F^{(m,s)}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nB^{(m,s)}&amp;\\coloneqq B &amp;&amp;(B\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L}),\\\\\n(\\neg F)^{(m,s)}&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg F^{(m,s)},\\\\\n(F\\circ G)^{(m,s)}&amp;\\coloneqq F^{(m,s)}\\circ G^{(m,s)}\n&amp;&amp;(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall x\\,F)^{(m,s)}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\,(x\\in A_m\\to F^{(m,s)}),\\\\\n(\\exists x\\,F)^{(m,s)}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\exists x\\,(x\\in A_s\\land F^{(m,s)}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_k^{(m,s)}(\\Delta)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\{F^{(f(F),g(F))}:F\\in\\Delta\\}:\nf\\in(m+1)^\\Delta,\\quad\ng\\in\\{i\\in\\omega:s\\le i\\le k\\}^{\\Delta}\n\\right\\},\n\\qquad F^{(m,m)}=F^{A_m}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_k^{(m,s)}(\\Delta)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\{F^{(f(F),g(F))}:F\\in\\Delta\\}:\nf\\in(m+1)^\\Delta,\\quad\ng\\in\\{i\\in\\omega:s\\le i\\le k\\}^{\\Delta}\n\\right\\},\n\\qquad F^{(m,m)}=F^{A_m}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definition 12.7.1：全称量词界 Am，存在量词界 As，D 允许逐公式进一步降低全称界、提高存在界。显式 k 只记录该实例可用的常元范围；空公式集的像族是 {∅}。递归仅调用严格子公式，故存在唯一；有限集的枚举置换不改变 D。等界时与通常相对化的等式由结构归纳逐分支成立。</p>\n<p>这是语法定义。一般否定语法上的字面扩展不尊重所有经典等价改写，例如先将否定全称改写成存在否定，会把相应的界从 Am 换成 As。后续若使用原书的对偶/单调性论证，须回到其 Tait 正规形片段。它本身不证明 KPi⁰ 到 KPₖ⁰ 的解释成立，也不自动提供 Γ₀ 上界；Exercise 12.7.2 的模型解释及后续归约仍是额外证明义务。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-relativization","status":"resolved","id":"ccb1a85e29ea0a39","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-relativization]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$A_0,\\ldots,A_k$ 是不同新常元。$F,G$ 是 $\\mathcal L=\\{\\in,=,\\mathrm{Ad}\\}$ 的一阶公式（语法见 [[./18-df-formula]]），$\\mathrm{Ad}$ 是一元关系符号；公式不含常元 $A_i$。","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-relativization","status":"resolved","id":"ccb1a85e29ea0a39","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Delta\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}]^{<\\omega}$。$D_k^{(m,s)}(\\Delta)$ 通过定义域恰为 $\\Delta$ 的选择函数取值，不使用未指定的公式枚举。目标语言为 $\\mathcal L_k=\\mathcal L\\cup\\{A_0,\\ldots,A_k\\}$；$F^{A_m}$ 使用 [[./18-df-relativization]] 在 $\\mathcal L_k$ 中的实例。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A_0,\\ldots,A_k","display":false},{"tex":"F,G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L=\\{\\in,=,\\mathrm{Ad}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ad}","display":false},{"tex":"A_i","display":false},{"tex":"m,s\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"0\\le m,s\\le k","display":false},{"tex":"F^{(m,s)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"D_k^{(m,s)}(\\Delta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_k=\\mathcal L\\cup\\{A_0,\\ldots,A_k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"F^{A_m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nB^{(m,s)}&\\coloneqq B &&(B\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L}),\\\\\n(\\neg F)^{(m,s)}&\\coloneqq\\neg F^{(m,s)},\\\\\n(F\\circ G)^{(m,s)}&\\coloneqq F^{(m,s)}\\circ G^{(m,s)}\n&&(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall x\\,F)^{(m,s)}&\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\,(x\\in A_m\\to F^{(m,s)}),\\\\\n(\\exists x\\,F)^{(m,s)}&\\coloneqq\n\\exists x\\,(x\\in A_s\\land F^{(m,s)}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"D_k^{(m,s)}(\\Delta)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\{F^{(f(F),g(F))}:F\\in\\Delta\\}:\nf\\in(m+1)^\\Delta,\\quad\ng\\in\\{i\\in\\omega:s\\le i\\le k\\}^{\\Delta}\n\\right\\},\n\\qquad F^{(m,m)}=F^{A_m}.","display":true}],"bytes":3569,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-asymmetric-relativization]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-asymmetric-relativization]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-asymmetric-relativization]]"}],"outgoing":["2718a8a11c383b33","ccb1a85e29ea0a39","0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f"]}